  <ThingDef ParentName="FurnitureBase">
    <defName>CVG_BronzeCenser</defName>
    <label>bronze censer</label>
    <description>A three-legged bronze censer for burning incense. Its fragrance lifts the mood and it raises the qi concentration of the room a little. Incense of the three-legged censer rises in a straight line when the room is at peace and curls when an enemy is near. Elders of the Heavenly Cauldron Pavilion test their guests by it.</description>
