  <ThingDef ParentName="FurnitureBase">
    <defName>CVG_KoiPond</defName>
    <label>koi pond</label>
    <description>A small stone-edged pond with colorful koi. Very beautiful and it raises the qi concentration of the room a good deal, but it needs space. The koi of the sect ponds are said to be carp that are still waiting for their turn at the Dragon Gate. Disciples feed them each dawn and ask them for nothing.</description>
